      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{(n-1)!+n!+(n+1)!}{(n+2)!+(n+3)!}&=\\frac{(n-1)![1+n+n(n+1)]}{(n+2)![1+(n+3)]}\\\\\\frac{(n-1)!+n!+(n+1)!}{(n+2)!+(n+3)!}&=\\frac{(n-1)!(n+1)^2}{(n+2)!(n+4)}\\\\\\frac{(n-1)!+n!+(n+1)!}{(n+2)!+(n+3)!}&=\\frac{(n-1)!(n+1)^2}{n(n+1)(n+2)(n-1)!(n+4)}\\\\\\frac{(n-1)!+n!+(n+1)!}{(n+2)!+(n+3)!}&=\\frac{n+1}{n(n+2)(n+4)}.\\end{align*}$$",
